==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{m|gmh|wandern}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|*wantaron||wantarōn}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*wandrōną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈvandɐn/|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|wan|dern|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-wandern.ogg|audio (Germany)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-at-wandern.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|wandert|wanderte|gewandert|auxiliary=both}}

# to [[hike]]
# to [[wander]]

====Conjugation====
{{de-conj-weak-ern|wand|gewandert|s}}
or rarely
{{de-conj-weak-ern|wand|gewandert|h}}

